PROBABILITY FUNCTIONS (x>0)
Power Series (x>0)
26.2.10   P(x)=\frac{1}{2}+\frac{1}{\sqrt{2x}}\sum_{n=0}^{\infty}\frac{(-1)^{n}x^{2n+1}}{n!2^{n}(2n+1)}
26.2.11   P(x)=\frac{1}{2}+Z(x)\sum_{n=0}^{\infty}\frac{x^{2n+1}}{1\cdot3\cdot5\dots(2n+1)}
Asymptotic Expansions (x>0)
26.2.12   Q(x)=\frac{Z(x)}{x}\left\{1-\frac{1}{x^{2}}+\frac{1\cdot3}{x^{4}}+\dots\right.\quad\qquad\